<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Business on Best of AI</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tags/business/</link><description>Recent content in Business on Best of AI</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://bestofai.io/tags/business/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>QueryStory</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/querystory/</link><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/querystory/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;QueryStory built what it calls an agentic data platform, meaning the system does more than store and visualize data the way a traditional BI tool does. It reasons across an organization&amp;rsquo;s data and business context, then produces recommendations meant to be acted on directly rather than dashboards a person still has to interpret and turn into a decision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The company emerged from stealth in San Francisco in August 2026 with $6 million in seed funding raised in late 2025. Its founders include CEO Naghibzadeh, CTO Stanley Yang, previously lead engineer at EvolutionIQ, and CPO David Glusic, an Accenture veteran, and the company says it already has Fortune 500 customers in regulated industries.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Encore AI</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/encore-ai/</link><pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/encore-ai/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Dataiku</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/dataiku/</link><pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/dataiku/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Born to Found</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/born-to-found/</link><pubDate>Thu, 16 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/born-to-found/</guid><description/></item><item><title>SwiftAlerts</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/swiftalerts/</link><pubDate>Mon, 22 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/swiftalerts/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Anomaly AI</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/anomaly-ai/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/anomaly-ai/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Igly</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/igly/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/igly/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Amplemarket</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/amplemarket/</link><pubDate>Mon, 15 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/amplemarket/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Arcade</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/arcade-software/</link><pubDate>Mon, 15 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/arcade-software/</guid><description/></item><item><title